h fresh jasmine blossoms, offering a smooth, floral and delicately sweet infusion. Moonlight Jasmine is an enchanting white tea with a soft, honeyed texture, layered with the soothing aroma of night-blooming jasmine. Another addition to our tea variety pack, the Matcha Super Green, is a vibrant green tea blend which delivers the rich umami of matcha with the refreshing taste of green tea, creating an energizing cup with smooth vegetal sweetness. A toasty and nutty classic, Genmaicha is made with sencha and roasted sticky rice that offers a satisfying balance of savory green tea and roasted grain flavor.</p><p><br>Turmeric Ginger, another staple in our loose leaf tea box, is a bold and warming blend with hints of lemongrass and citrus, ideal for wellness and vitality. This fruity, tangy herbal Hibiscus Berry tea combines hibiscus, elderberries and rosehips to create a bright, quenching infusion with notes of pomegranate and mango. A calming herbal blend of golden chamomile flowers with refreshing mint and floral accents, Chamomile Medley is an essential addition to our tea variety pack and is perfect for unwinding and relaxation. A bold and malty black tea from Yunnan Province, China, China Breakfast has smooth, rich flavors ideal for starting the day strong.</p><p><br>Golden Yunnan offers a full-bodied cup with notes of cocoa, honey and subtle spice, showcasing the complexity of Chinese black teas. No organic tea gift box would be complete without Earl Grey, an iconic black tea that is scented with bright, citrusy bergamot, creating a classic and aromatic infusion. A warming blend of Assam black tea and aromatic spices like cardamom, cinnamon and ginger, Masala Chai is perfect for making traditional chai lattes. Pu'er Ginger offers an earthy, fermented pu'er tea paired with zesty ginger, orange peel and lemongrass for an invigorating, full-bodied brew.</p><p><br>This carefully crafted organic tea gift box brings together a world-class selection of teas, offering a rich and varied journey through global tea traditions. Perfect for tea lovers or as an indulgent gift, this tea variety pack offers something for every palate and occasion.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="13c69f28-1d4e-44c4-8a93-32f7ec8f3485" class="r-1ln50kn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="bfbe0fc0-c29f-4221-950e-49fd5300469a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rtnsb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1xrgv24"><div data-rid="5fdfbb62-19ad-4aaf-a3b5-ded2498a7cca" class="r-rxgssx alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-b1a66650-0625-4702-9369-9eb00cd5e23e-styles-f0cb1915-e0f2-494e-b323-0d9ee8914857-attributes-color:#283645"><span style="width:100%"><p>REVIEWS</p></span></div><div data-rid="19f66cec-5f65-42de-8f1f-6e6518412ed4" class="r-1adi71l" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-xbfhrq" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rtnsb2:"><div data-rid="6ba84fa7-9248-49c5-8550-74a95f819e6a" class="r-alnnzj"><div data-rid="c409f358-aa70-4415-b3da-69fd046e0fd8" class="r-1pnxzw8" data-alchemy-prerendered-component-id="c409f358-aa70-4415-b3da-69fd046e0fd8">{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-alchemy-prerendered-placeholder="true">
